      "content": "Hey, i'm working on the reproducibility part of the paper for the topological phase discovery we found. The reviewers are gonna be hawks about this, so i need to show that the results aren't just a fluke of your specific fine-tuning. I need to run a pruning pass to strip out the specialized heuristic layers so we can get a baseline with a standard model. Can you help me identify which weight clusters are most specific to the high-level pattern matching vs the core physics knowledge?",
